00:01:54.680 --> 00:02:01.040
directly to a volatility adjusted allocation approach. This strategy involves screening for stocks

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:06.520
or sectors with depressed multiples that can buffer against macro shocks rather than chasing

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.580
pure momentum. In today's environment of more frequent geopolitical events and supply

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:18.520
disruptions, the tactic starts with pulling a list of names trading below their 200-day average

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:25.180
