00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:31.220
alerts for volume above the 20-day average combined with forward PE below sector medians.

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:37.640
The approach worked best during 2022's rate hike cycle when value and defensive holdings

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:43.840
