00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:50.400
if growth re-accelerates, so always pair the screen with same-day volume confirmation to avoid false

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:56.920
rebounds. That same defensive mindset applies when Canadians look beyond their homes for real estate

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:03.220
exposure. This is a simulated trade for educational purposes only. No real money is involved.

